<title>UK: Turkey seeks 60,000 tonnes fuel oil in Dec - trade.</title>
<headline>Turkey seeks 60,000 tonnes fuel oil in Dec - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish state oil company Tupras issued a tender to buy 60,000 tonnes of low sulphur fuel oil for December delivery, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender asked for two cargoes, one straight-run and one cracked, for delivery in Izmir or Tutunciftlik in Dec 10-12 and Dec 15-17.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
